+#### .getPost(id)
+
+Gets a post.
+
+```javascript
+api.getPost('<user_id>')
+  .then(res => console.log(res.data.aweme_detail))
+  .catch(console.log);
+
+// Outputs:
+// { author: {...}, aweme_id: '999', desc: 'description', music: {...}, statistics: {...}, video: {...}, ... }
+
+```
+
+See the [post types](src/types/post.d.ts) for the complete response object.
+
 #### .listPosts(params)
 
 Lists a user's posts.
